  "summary_zh": "停好車，付好停車費，旁邊的廁所非常的新與高級。\n\n從停車場開始，一路上行到瀑布，步行時間約 50 分鐘，這一路上並不難走，但稍徒一點，到後面就比較好走，請保留時間前往。\n\n來回就要 100 分鐘，要衡量你的旅程來規畫，而途中還會經過小角瀑布 Litlanesfoss 是一段路可以看到兩個瀑布。",
  "summary_en": "Park your car and pay the parking fee; the nearby restroom is modern and upscale. From the parking area, the walk to the waterfall takes about 50 minutes. The path is generally easy, though slightly uneven at first, becoming smoother later—allow enough time. The round‑trip takes roughly 100 minutes, so plan your itinerary accordingly. Along the way you’ll also pass the smaller Litlanesfoss waterfall, offering a view of two falls.",
